Source: oai-fdw
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libcurl4-openssl-dev, libxml2-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jimjonesbr/oai_fdw

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-oai-fdw
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-oai-fdw
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: OAI-PMH foreign data wrapper for PostgreSQL
 Read metadata from OAI-PMH repositories over HTTP or HTTPS through foreign
 tables. This is a read-only wrapper using libcurl and libxml2. Distribution
 version 1.16.0 uses the upstream SQL extension version 1.16.
